  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f73" contextRef="c1">&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;calibri&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #222222;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;1.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="color: #222222;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;calibri&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;Balance Sheet Schedule110 - Account 67 Asset Retirement Obligations&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;calibri&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;calibri&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;The asset retirement obligation is reflected at the fair value of estimated future costs, which are expected to be incurred during continuing operations and at the end of Arrowhead Gulf Coast Pipeline&amp;#8217;s life. &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;calibri&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;table style="border: none;border-collapse: collapse;margin-bottom: .001pt;width: 5.66in;"&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 0.34in;"&gt;&lt;td style="background: #dce6f1;border-bottom: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-left-style: none;border-right: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-top: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: bottom;width: 126.1pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;calibri&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;